  "switches": {
    "about": "Ranking switches on the cards that change which pool a number is ranked in. The check does not find these on its own; they are listed so the choice is on the record.",
    "football: rank against all-time": "Covered: every football profile stat carries its all-time percentile.",
    "football: rank against the same point of past seasons": "Covered: nfl_get_player_profile rank_against same_point.",
    "football: last 4, 8 or 17 games on the card": "Covered as recent form in nfl_player_games and as window boards in nfl_leaderboard; a whole card in a window is not.",
    "football: rank against the same experience, side of the ball, or a snap-share band": "Left out: each needs a pool of every season (experience) or the card re-ranked per request; the size of the files it would take is not worth it until fans ask.",
    "basketball: rank against a minutes-per-game band": "Left out for now: a re-ranking of the same numbers; the leaderboard's min_mpg filter answers most of what it is for.",
